				1035,
				223
			],
			"Message": "build(Wind): Minify ESBuild configuration and Target output files\n\nRebuild the ESBuild configuration files (BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig, constants, and index files) and the compiled Target output with minification enabled. The Configuration/ESBuild source files are compressed from multi-line readable format to single-line minified output, while the Target/ directory files are rebuilt with reduced file sizes through variable renaming, dead code elimination, and compression.\n\nThis minification reduces the overall bundle size and improves load times for the Wind UI service layer.",
			"SHA": "7f0bfd4247712edcfac7b2780fac1424b85fa4ce"
